00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.740
and you're developing other opportunities,

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:15.560
while you wait.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.400
You hustle, while you wait.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.300
So as an example, if i wanted to grow this Salsa Dance business, right?

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:21.160
I want to grow the studio

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.000
I want to get lots more students coming in,

