is take out a direct-mail campaign.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.120
Ok? I'm going to do a direct mail campaign

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:32.560
and I'm going to blast

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:34.320
cards to everyone who's in

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:35.440
