00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:38.440
That's gonna take some time, right?

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:40.080
It's gonna take some time to develop the artwork

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:40.580
to then

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.060
figure out how we're going to distribute them.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:42.560
to then

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.360
get them into the hands of the people living in the neighborhoods.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:45.860
to then

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:48.420
wait for the next schedule to open up for people to sign up

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:48.920
to then

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.260
wait for them to actually come and buy a class

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:51.760
to then

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:52.780
wait for them to actually come and

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:53.500
put their money down

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.000
and show up for the class, right?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:55.940
That's a process

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:56.900
it takes time.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:58.820
I need to wait for that to happen

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.600
but while I'm waiting for that to happen

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:02.020
I'm not just sitting on my hands.

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.100
I'm doing other things because

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.660
my goal is to grow this business.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:07.040
So I'm going to be making youtube videos

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:07.700
I'm going to be

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.700
improving the customer experience.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:10.420
I'm going to be

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:12.520
improving the location and the environment.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.880
I'm going to be looking at: what's the signage

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:15.820
