00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:16.460
I'm going to be looking at

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:17.860
what else can I do with social media?

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.820
What else can I do to get into mainstream media?

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.400
I'm going to be HUSTLING...

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:22.920
...while I'm waiting.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:25.160
So waiting is part of the game, but don't be lazy

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.800
don't just wait on one thing to happen

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:28.320
start other projects!

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.180
While you're waiting for the first thing to happen.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:33.920
don't be lazy.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:35.440
#believe.

